---
description: Prepare one recoverContinuity evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: TheatreCuePlan[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: When cast, props, or audience paths change, propose bounded in-character recovery material and feasible scene adjustments. Preserve revealed facts and participant boundaries, obtain stage-manager approval, and log the actual path for subsequent scenes and post-show reset. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
